{"t":"delta","ts":"2026-11-08T10:00:00.170Z","id":"b2","text":"    const std::string very_long_line = \"这一行故意写得很长很长很长很长很长很长很长很长很长很长很长很长很长很长很长很长很长很长很长很长，目的是超出版心 760px 逼出横向滚动条\";\n","seq":13}
{"t":"delta","ts":"2026-11-08T10:00:00.180Z","id":"b2","text":"    return 0;\n","seq":14}
{"t":"delta","ts":"2026-11-08T10:00:00.190Z","id":"b2","text":"}\n","seq":15}
{"t":"delta","ts":"2026-11-08T10:00:00.200Z","id":"b2","text":"```\n\n","seq":16}
{"t":"delta","ts":"2026-11-08T10:00:00.210Z","id":"b2","text":"无序列表：\n\n","seq":17}
{"t":"delta","ts":"2026-11-08T10:00:00.220Z","id":"b2","text":"- 第一项\n","seq":18}
{"t":"delta","ts":"2026-11-08T10:00:00.230Z","id":"b2","text":"- 第二项，带点长度看看悬挂缩进对不对\n","seq":19}
{"t":"delta","ts":"2026-11-08T10:00:00.240Z","id":"b2","text":"  - 嵌套的子项\n","seq":20}
{"t":"delta","ts":"2026-11-08T10:00:00.250Z","id":"b2","text":"- 第三项\n\n","seq":21}
{"t":"delta","ts":"2026-11-08T10:00:00.260Z","id":"b2","text":"有序列表（原文序号 1/2/3，不重排）：\n\n","seq":22}
{"t":"delta","ts":"2026-11-08T10:00:00.270Z","id":"b2","text":"1. 第一步\n","seq":23}
{"t":"delta","ts":"2026-11-08T10:00:00.280Z","id":"b2","text":"2. 第二步\n","seq":24}
{"t":"delta","ts":"2026-11-08T10:00:00.290Z","id":"b2","text":"3. 第三步\n\n","seq":25}
